      "created_at": "2018-08-26T23:57:58.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I was playing a game with Guise, Extreme Skyscraper and Mr. Fixer. Guise thought he should borrow Mr. Fixers dual&nbsp;crowbars and he can do that too, to Extreme Skyscraper tiny power. He delt a large amount of damage to a target with links, as you do, and then he delt a second target more damage it was almost dead and then he got to deal the second damage from dual&nbsp;crowbars again. I rewinded and it did it again, I finished that game and did another game with the same 3 heros in it against a different villian and it did the same results of the second instance of dual&nbsp;crowbars going off. I did also try i can do that too on Mr. fixers poer and it only did the two damage instances, and guises base power only did the two damage instances.</p>",
